\f0\fs22 Any Cloudborne that might have recognised him, certainly wouldn\'92t equate the hale-and-hearty, moderately well-dressed food-queuer with the cleaner/drunk they used to know. Only in-the-know Elvi might clock him as the Great Teacher.\
\'93Great Teacher!\'94 one of the \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 Elvines at the grill exclaimed. Her tongs stopped mid-air while she stammered, \'93How do you want your eggs?\'94\
\'93Hard-scrambled,\'94 Chanta answered.\
The band on stage abruptly stopped and everyone rubber-necked to look for why.\
\'93Friends! I have great news,\'94 the vocalist announced, and his words echoed around the canyon of  buildings. \'93The Blessed Herald of the Dawkins! The Giver of the Lyrics. He\'92s arrived! Everyone\'85 I give you, the Great Teacher!\'94\
The applause made Chanta\'92s cap ache.\
